{"id":"H5416","lemma":"נָתָן","transliteration":"natan","sayIt":"na-TAN","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Nathan","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.5.14;\nson of: David (H1732) and Bathsheba (H1339);\nbrother of: Shammua (H8051H), Shobab (H7727) and Solomon (H8010);\nhalf-brother of: Amnon (H0550), Chileab (H3609), Absalom (H0053), Adonijah (H0138), Shephatiah (H8203), Ithream (H3507), Ibhar (H2984), Elishua (H0474), Nepheg (H5298H), Japhia (H3309I), Elishama (H0476H), Eliada (H0450), Eliphelet (H0467), Tamar (H8559H), Elpelet (H0467I), Nogah (H5052) and Jerimoth (H3406N);\nfather of: Mattatha (G3160)\nAlso named: Nathan (Ναθάν \"Nathan\" G3481)\n§ Nathan = \"giver\"\n1) a son of David by Bathsheba\n2) the eminent prophet in the time of David and Solomon\n3) a man of Zobah, father of one of David's mighty warriors\n4) father of Azariah who was over the officers of Solomon\n5) son of Attai and father of Zabad of the tribe of Judah\n6) brother of Joel of the tribe of Judah\n7) one of the head men who returned from Babylon with Ezra\n8) a man with a foreign wife in the time of Ezra\n9) head of a family of Israel who shall mourn when they look on Him whom they pierced","glosses":["nathan","then nathan","after nathan"],"count":39,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-5","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nathan","kjv":"and Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-7","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nathan","kjv":"unto Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-7","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Nathan","kjv":"And Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-7","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nathan","kjv":"came unto Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-7","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nathan","kjv":"so did Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-12","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nathan","kjv":"Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-12","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nathan","kjv":"to Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-12","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Nathan","kjv":"And Nathan"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-12","v